stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> validating: Ask about an exact activity
    validating --> invalid: Malformed or extra arguments
    validating --> unauthorized: Caller lacks partner authority
    validating --> reading: Partner supplies a valid UUID
    reading --> ready: Activity has a live direct deal
    reading --> needs_input: Source links require review or are missing
    reading --> empty: Activity is unknown or inaccessible
    reading --> unavailable: Source fails or exceeds the cap
    %% never Credit an activity to a candidate inferred from names or contact membership.
    %% never Show a retired or inaccessible subject.
